## What we still don't do (intentional v1 holdback)

1. **Auto-loading video** — older-B2B audience, slow rural connections, mobile data caps. Out.
2. **Hotspot "shop the look"** — adds JS complexity. Replaced with a static lookbook teaser that links to category PLPs.
3. **Live chat widget** — not requested, brief explicitly excludes "chatbot widget."
4. **Cookie banner** — not requested; per brief, "no cookie banner unless explicitly requested."
5. **Recently viewed rail** — brief explicitly says no.
6. **Sustainability/cert badges** — held until customer supplies real audited claims.
7. **Numbered/limited-drop language** — only credible if Magic Scarf actually does drops; flagged in notes for product team to confirm.

